---
import SectionHeading from '@/components/ui/SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="scroll-mt-16 px-6 py-20 sm:px-10 lg:py-28 max-w-2xl">
  <SectionHeading index="01" title="About" />

  <div class="space-y-5 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
    <p>
      I'm
      <a
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sameerzaheer/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-accent-bright underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-accent transition-colors"
      >Sameer Zaheer</a>, an AI/ML engineering leader with 12+ years of experience, now
      focused on AI and robotics for mining and the physical world. Through
      <strong class="text-fg font-medium">AutomateThis</strong>, I take on production AI/ML
      projects end-to-end.
    </p>
    <p>
      Previously: CTO at
      <a
        href="https://actuality.live"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-accent-bright underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-accent transition-colors"
      >Actuality.live</a> (prototype to 200+ daily users), ML lead at
      <a
        href="https://www.soundhound.com/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-accent-bright underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-accent transition-colors"
      >SoundHound</a>, Forward Deployed Engineer at
      <a
        href="https://www.palantir.com/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-accent-bright underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-accent transition-colors"
      >Palantir</a>. I hold 4 patents.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you have a problem worth automating, let's talk.
    </p>
    <p class="pt-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-fg-subtle">
      The Team
    </p>
    <p>
      Alongside me, AutomateThis's team has hands-on experience across AI
      agents, full-stack application development, computer vision, and
      production ML. We also partner with other consulting firms.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
